ise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.2174,"r5":0.1359,"r1_spy":0.2226,"r5_spy":0.1288}}],"quotes":[{"c":"RHI 2018 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2018-04-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"The fact that pay rates are rising and clients acknowledge they are having to pay more gives us cover not only to pass through the additional pay rate but also to recover those additional fringes as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/25/robert-half-international-rhi-q1-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2018 Q2","e":"rhi","d":"2018-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Analyst","x":"And then I guess, I mean, I know it's fairly early and we don't have a lot of detail but have you heard any clients talking about tariff policy?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/25/robert-half-international-rhi-q2-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2018 Q2","e":"rhi","d":"2018-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"I don't think yet we're having specific discussions or we've got specific concerns about tariffs per se.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/25/robert-half-international-rhi-q2-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2018 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2018-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"That's a direct reflection of some higher wage inflation that we're seeing across our lines of business that not only are we passing through but we're actually expanding our margins as well which our numbers reflect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2018 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2018-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"But from a directional standpoint, we do think we can pass through as supply continues to tighten and clients more and more accept that that's the reality of the marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2018 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2018-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"We've been able to offset that by streamlining the discovery part of the candidate sourcing and recruiting process with our technology investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2018 Q4","e":"rhi","d":"2019-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"And we can all debate interest rates, tariffs, China, the Fed, all of those are interesting discussion points but the point is, we're in a candidate-short market, not only in the United States but globally.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/robert-half-international-rhi-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2018 Q4","e":"rhi","d":"2019-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"With the wage inflation that we expect to continue, we expect to be, to pass that on and continue to widen our spreads a bit from here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/robert-half-international-rhi-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2019 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2019-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"So it's base pay increases and promotions, both happen all at once and you don't pass those through all at once.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2019 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2019-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"We lowered our guidance to one quarter, all estimates we provide on the call are subject to the risk mentioned in today's press release and in our SEC filings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2019 Q2","e":"rhi","d":"2019-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"So while we believe we can modestly expand our gross margins from here our objective one is to pass through wage inflation, which we're doing and objective two is to modestly expand gross margins understanding we're already of the highest margin supplier in most local markets relative to our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2019 Q4","e":"rhi","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"Gross margins year-over-year, flat with last year, plus or minus 10 to 20 basis points as we continue to pass-through wage increases and our bill rate increased 5.2% in the fourth quarter versus a year ago, and we would expect to see that trend into the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2019 Q4","e":"rhi","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"And so Protiviti clearly is having to pay its new staff more and it's impacted by wage inflation generally, which it is successfully passing through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2019 Q4","e":"rhi","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"So on the Workday Financials front, I mean, typically changing financial systems isn't an efficiency/cost-reduction-driven endeavor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2019 Q4","e":"rhi","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"Although, I will say, we will be going from on-premise to cloud, and that should drive some cost reduction and some efficiency, but it's basically a new financial system, accounts payable, accounts receivable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2020 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"We've made significant investments in AI and other things that we've talked about many times on these calls.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2020 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael C. Buckley","x":"Given the timing of these reductions and certain severance costs, reported results in the second quarter will only reflect savings of approximately 25% versus the first quarter of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2020 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"Well, orders of magnitude, the first round of reductions, we had severance of about $5 million and that was recorded in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2020 Q2","e":"rhi","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"The timing of those actions which occurred over the course of the quarter as well as certain employee compensation-related items, such as severance and salary continuation, reduced the savings actually reported in the second quarter to 24%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2020 Q2","e":"rhi","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael C. Buckley","x":"In addition, as Keith noted earlier, the timing of our cost reduction actions, including compensation related costs associated with employee terminations impacted total SG&A expense for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"RHI 2021 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2021-04-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"Our investments in advanced AI technologies have allowed us to adapt quickly to a new marketplace, where remote and hybrid work has become commonplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHI 2021 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2021-04-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"It's -- I would say, wage inflation is usually our friend and as the candidate side tightens, which it's already doing and is expected to further that, not only do we traditionally pass through the higher pay rate, but it also gives us an opportunity to also widen our spread a bit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHI 2021 Q2","e":"rhi","d":"2021-07-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"We also strengthened our investments in advanced AI technologies, enabling our professionals to help clients with critical talent and consulting needs and find solutions across broad resource pools.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q2-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHI 2021 Q2","e":"rhi","d":"2021-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"We're passing through the wage inflation that we're having, and we've actually expanded our margin some.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/23/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q2-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHI 2021 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"We have a multi-decade track record of passing through our wage inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q3-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHI 2021 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"M. Keith Waddell","x":"Typically, for us, for a three to five-year period, we would see mid-single-digit wage inflation that we would pass through and, in fact, expand our margins a bit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/robert-half-international-inc-rhi-q3-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"RHI 2026 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2026-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"M. Waddell","x":"Last year, it was tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/robert-half-rhi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RHI 2026 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2026-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Waddell","x":"Interestingly, if you would pro forma our Q2 guidance and you would not only give effect to the severance, but you would also apply the cost savings as if they were in place then.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/robert-half-rhi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RHI 2026 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2026-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"M. Waddell","x":"So you'd add $0.03 for severance and you'd add $0.05 for cost savings to get a total of $0.08.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/robert-half-rhi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RHI 2026 Q1","e":"rhi","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Stephanie Benjamin Moore","x":"So maybe if you could just address maybe any strategic changes around end markets or jobs that you would look to address that might not be so in line with being potentially disintermediated by AI?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/robert-half-rhi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RHI 2026 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Stephanie Benjamin Moore","x":"I wanted to touch on your AI investments I know that you have implemented a lot of investments over the last 12 months or so.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/robert-half-rhi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RHI 2026 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"Well, to the extent we took cost out of the business, those certainly accrue to the fourth quarter as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/robert-half-rhi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RHI 2026 Q3","e":"rhi","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Keith Waddell","x":"And so, again, I would say, rather than focus first on cost savings and productivity, it is more around expanding access to clients access to candidates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/robert-half-rhi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,6490,0,0,0,4935,1126],[34,1,6626,0,0,0,5053,1129],[35,1,5220,0,0,0,3950,799],[36,1,6962,0,0,0,5323,1238],[37,1,7305,0,0,0,5234,1138],[38,1,6215,0,0,0,4696,987],[39,1,4866,0,0,0,3592,878],[40,1,7585,0,0,0,6017,1079],[41,1,8287,0,0,0,6464,1381],[42,1,6701,0,0,0,5344,974],[43,1,7217,0,0,0,5644,1095],[44,1,6446,0,0,0,4916,1090],[45,1,6465,0,0,0,4841,1228],[46,1,7985,0,0,0,6113,1495],[47,1,6828,0,0,0,5417,1019],[65,1,7025,0,0,0,4067,982],[67,1,6777,0,0,0,1430,4893]],"cinema":[[33,1,6490,0,0,0,4935,1126],[34,1,6626,0,0,0,5053,1129],[35,1,5220,0,0,0,3950,799],[36,1,6962,0,0,0,5323,1238],[37,1,7305,0,0,0,5234,1138],[38,1,6215,0,0,0,4696,987],[39,1,4866,0,0,0,3592,878],[40,1,7585,0,0,0,6017,1079],[41,1,8287,0,0,0,6464,1381],[42,1,6701,0,0,0,5344,974],[43,1,7217,0,0,0,5644,1095],[44,1,6446,0,0,0,4916,1090],[45,1,6465,0,0,0,4841,1228],[46,1,7985,0,0,0,6113,1495],[47,1,6828,0,0,0,5417,1019],[65,1